<title>GERMANY: Siemens ind.unit 5-mo 96/97 new orders down.</title>
<headline>Siemens ind.unit 5-mo 96/97 new orders down.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Five months to the end of September 1996/97</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    New orders				   10,200  vs 10,400</p>
<p>    Sales					  7,700   up one pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German electronics and industrial group is Siemens AG. The figures given are for the group's industry division.</p>
</text>
